Description: Hardware temperature monitoring tool
 Psensor is a hardware temperature monitoring tool for Linux.
 It monitors temperature sensors, fan speeds, voltage, and more.
 .
 Features:
  * Monitor CPU and GPU temperature
  * Monitor hard disk temperature
  * Monitor fan speed
  * System tray indicator
  * Alerts and notifications
  * Graphs and history